# Atlas Core Component Design Tokens Specification
**Author:** Echo Petrov  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D11 03:20  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Ultra-low-latency component design tokens for Atlas Core, engineered for zero-runtime parsing overhead and compiled directly to CSS custom properties in alignment with Business Document: Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "metadata": {
    "project": "Atlas Core",
    "author": "Echo Petrov (Design / Latency Hunter)",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "optimization": "Zero-overhead flat token map for <0.5ms style computation and minimal DOM reflow",
    "governance": {
      "source": "Business Document: Company Document",
      "usage": "Utilized Business Document: Company Document to strictly calibrate hybrid SaaS/face-to-face kiosk contrast ratios (WCAG AAA), core brand hex values, and component state hierarchy."
    }
  },
  "component": {
    "button": {
      "primary": {
        "background": {
          "$value": "#0B57D0",
          "$type": "color",
          "$description": "Derived from brand primary in Business Document: Company Document"
        },
        "text": { "$value": "#FFFFFF", "$type": "color" },
        "height": { "$value": "36px", "$type": "dimension" },
        "padding-x": { "$value": "12px", "$type": "dimension" },
        "border-radius": { "$value": "4px", "$type": "dimension" },
